        "description": "Shyvana gains a shield, movement speed, and after a short delay, the area around her detonates.  While in Dragon Form, the explosion will heal her if it strikes an enemy champion.",
        "tooltip": "Shyvana wraps herself in flames for 2.5 seconds, gaining <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(60/80/100/120/140 + (12% bonus Health)) Shield</span>, increased by <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">(18/24/30/36/42 + (3.6% bonus Health))</span> per nearby enemy champion and <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">25% Move Speed</span>, increased to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">43.75%</span> when moving towards enemy champions.<br /><br />When the effect ends, the <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shield</span> is broken, or upon <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> the area around her detonates, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/100/120/140/160 + (65% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form:</span> If the detonation hits an enemy champion Shyvana heals for <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"> (60 ~ 100) + (4% ~ 8%) Missing Health</span>.",
