      {
        "id": "ShyvanaR",
        "name": "Dragon's Descent",
        "description": "Shyvana transforms into a Dragon and leaps forward causing enemies along her path to flee. While in Dragon form she becomes larger and her basic abilities are empowered.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive</span>: Shyvana generates <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">1.25 Dragon Fury</span> by striking enemies with Attacks and Abilities, increased by 200% while in <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form</span>, and reduced 75% by when striking in an area against non-champions.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active</span>: Shyvana transforms into her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Form</span>, becoming <span>Unstoppable</span>, and flying to the target location breathing fire on enemies below dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and causing them <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Flee for 0.75 seconds</span>.<br /><br />While transformed, Shyvana's basic Abilities are upgraded, she gains <span>150/250/350 bonus Health</span>, size, and Attack Range. Shyvana loses <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Fury</span> over time and her transformation ends when she has no <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Dragon Fury</span> remaining.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Shyvana gains 1% increased Fury from all sources per 1 Ultimate Ability Haste. Ultimate Haste acquired while dead does not take effect until Shyvana revives.</span>",
